{
  "title": "Penseira",
  "description": "Puts on a thinking hat and helps you better understand a problem",
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0f2a014d-a442-4e21-ad68-2ab25f6e0531",
      "type": "embed://a2/generate.bgl.json#module:main",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Co-think Assistant",
        "visual": {
          "x": 900,
          "y": 340
        },
        "userModified": true,
        "expected_output": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "description": "Conversational text helping user understand their problem.",
            "list": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "configuration": {
        "config$prompt": {
          "role": "user",
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Act as a co-thinker: chat with the user to help them better understand the problem they are having. {{\"type\":\"tool\",\"path\":\"function-group/use-memory\",\"title\":\"Use Memory\"}} to retrieve conversation history.\n\nToda a conversa deverá ser em portugues do Brasil.\n\n1. Bootstrap: if there is no conversation history present. introduce yourself and ask for the user's name. Otherwise, greet the user, give them a brief summary of the last few things you've discussed. Give them a choice to start working on a new problem or pick up where you two left off.\n\n2. Help the user better understand the problem by asking them about the nature of the problem and try to carefully expand your and user's understanding of the problem. Apply various mental model frameworks that help with sensemaking to help the user get more insights.\n\n3. Continue indefinitely."
            }
          ]
        },
        "generation-mode": "agent"
      }
    }
  ],
